flowchart TD
    %% ──────────── TRIGGERS ────────────
    A[Code Push / PR Trigger] --> B[Checkout Repository]
    B --> C[Detect Changed Services frontend/backend]

    C --> F
    C --> BE

    %% ──────────── FRONTEND PIPELINE ────────────
    subgraph F[Frontend Pipeline]
        F1[Install Dependencies]
        F2[Run Lint and Unit Tests]
        F3[Build Production Bundle]
        F4[Build Docker Image]
        F1 --> F2 --> F3 --> F4
    end

    %% ──────────── BACKEND PIPELINE ────────────
    subgraph BE[Backend Pipeline]
        BE1[Install Dependencies]
        BE2[Run Lint and Unit Tests]
        BE3[Build Binary / Package]
        BE4[Build Docker Image]
        BE1 --> BE2 --> BE3 --> BE4
    end

    %% ──────────── SECURITY AND REGISTRY ────────────
    F4 --> SEC[Security Scan and Image Signing]
    BE4 --> SEC
    SEC --> R[Push Images to Registry]

    %% ──────────── STAGING DEPLOY ────────────
    R --> STG[Deploy to Staging Environment]
    STG --> TEST[Functional and Integration Tests]
    TEST --> GATE{All Tests Passed?}

    GATE -- "No" --> FAIL[Fail Pipeline and Notify Team]
    GATE -- "Yes" --> APPROVE[Manual Approval for Production]

    %% ──────────── PRODUCTION DEPLOY ────────────
    APPROVE --> DEPLOY[Deploy to Production Cluster]
    DEPLOY --> VERIFY{Verify successful}
    VERIFY --> | Fail | ROLLBACK[Rollback to previous deployment]
    VERIFY --> | Success |SUCCESS[Release Marked Successful]

